{"id":"koren_","lemma":"корень","pos":"noun","rank":4798,"glosses":["root","root, radical"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/df/Ru-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"корня","plural":"корни"},"examples":[{"text":"Мои корни там.","en":"My roots are there.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null,{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Это корень проблемы.","en":"This is the root of the problem.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"problem","l":"проблема"}]},{"text":"Деньги - корень всех зол.","en":"Money is the root of all evil.","words":[{"g":"money"},null,{"g":"all","l":"весь"},{"g":"wicked","l":"злой"}]},{"text":"Том никогда не забывал свои корни.","en":"Tom never forgot his roots.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"never, nevermore"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to forget","l":"забывать"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null]},{"text":"Том споткнулся о корень.","en":"Tom tripped on a root.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"about"},null]}]}